// FAQ
section#ask-question.section.section-lg.bg-transparent
	.container
		.text-center( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInUp' } )
			h2 Common Questions
			p.lead Here you can find the answers to the most frequently asked questions about our event.
		.row.row-offset-lg.row-30.row-xl-50
			.col-lg-6( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInUp' } )
				h4 Which attractions are available?
				p In winter, all attractions, with the exception of selected water attractions, are open for you. Due to the weather, however, attractions may have to be closed at short notice.
			.col-lg-6( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInUp' } )
				h4 Can guests join us later?
				p All entrances are open until 8 p.m., so that late arrivals can join the arrangements with an evening event. From 8 pm the venue can only be entered via the secondary entrance.
			.col-lg-6( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInUp' } )
				h4 Where can I leave my luggage?
				p There are lockers in various places of the entertainment center, which can be used by your guests. The lockers are separately marked on the map. We recommend to find a locker before visiting the event venue.
			.col-lg-6( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInUp' } )
				h4 Is there a shuttle for all guests?
				p Your guests can use our regular shuttle from 30 minutes before the opening of the venue and up to 75 minutes after its closing at a fare of $ 3.00 (departure from the local train stations).
			.col-lg-6( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInUp' } )
				h4 Where can I park?
				p In general, all visitors of the Christmas event can use our parking spaces P1 (Mystery) and P2 (China Town). On arrival, you will be allocated a parking space by our traffic service staff.